  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mirai no Mori &amp; KIWL partnership 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knights In White Lycra is a Japan-based fundraising group of people of all ages and backgrounds who &apos;get fit &amp; give back&apos; through sporting events. KIWL has raised over Y115 million to help children from challenged backgrounds, to dream of a better outcome in adult life. KIWL has chosen to support Mirai no Mori NPO in 2023, who create life-changing outdoor programs for abused, neglected, and orphaned children in Japan, supporting their growth into happy and successful young adults.</narrative>
  </description>
